  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obonene bw’Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase igo bono mwanche Omonene Nyasae oino, botambe mobwate aya achiikire, n’emeroberio yaye echiikire, n’amachiiko aye onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria reero inyora buna Omonene Nyasae oino, akobaa egesusuro ase okobarongeyia. (Tindi gokwana ase abana baino, baria bataramanya gose batararora amang’ana ayio.) Inyora obonene bwaye n’okoboko kwaye kore ne chinguru koramboire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ebikone biaye, na ogokora kwaye okwo akorete agwo Misiri ase Farao omorwoti, na ase abanto b’ense yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyora naende buna akorete ase abarwani b’esegi ba Misiri, ne’chibarasi chiabo, ne’chigari chiabo, na buna atigete amaache y’Enyancha Embariri akabamera, ekero barenge kobabwatia inwe, na buna basirete tibana kororekana goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Momanyete buna Omonene abakorerete, ekero mwarenge ase erooro, goika mogaacha aase aa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Moinyorete buna akorete Datani na Abiiramu, abana b’Eliabu, ab’ororeeria rwa Rubeni. Ase amasio y’Abaisraeli bonsi riroba rikabwereka, rikabamera, amo ne’chiamate chiabo, ne’chiema, ne’chitugo, n’abwo bonsi baababwatetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe ’mwarooche n’amaiso aino emeremo yonsi emenene Omonene akorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosesenigwa gw’ense eria Abaisraeli barieretwe eira koegwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mobwate amachiiko onsi ayio inche ’nkobaa rituko ria reero; erio nario moraabe ne chinguru, erinde mosoe ase ense eria mogochia koira, ebe eyaino,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende amatuko aino anyare koba amaange ase ense eri’Omonene arierete chisokoro chiaino eira ng’a ’n’abayee barabwo na ororeeria rwabo, ense entenenku ere n’amabeere n’amooke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense eria mogochia gosoa moyeire teri buna ense ya Misiri agwo ase mwarwa. Aroro nigo mwarenge kobusura chimbusuro chiaino, naende mwakora emeremo y’ogosiarera amaache, buna mogosiarera amaache ase egeticha gie chinyeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ense eria mogochia gosoa moyeire nigo ere ense y’ebitunwa n’amagoko, ense ekonyoora embura egotwa korwa igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene Nyasae oino, nigo agwechaandera ense eyio. Amaiso y’Omonene Nyasae oino, botambe nigo ayerigereretie korwa omochakano bw’omwaka na goika omoerio oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Komoraigwere amachiiko aya nabaeire rituko ria reero, erinde mwanche Omonene Nyasae oino, na komokorera ne’chinkoro chiaino chionsi, n’emioyo yaino yonsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio ere nabatwerie embura ase ense yaino ase engaki egwenerete, embura ye ritang’ani na ey’okwamia endagera nainwe ’monyoore endagera, n’edivai, n’amaguta y’emazeituni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabae obonyansi ase ebitii ase chitugo chiaino chikoriisia. Inwe nigo moranyore endagera mokoria, moigote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende mono chinkoro chiaino tichibang’aina. Timobaisa gotiga Omonene na gokorera chinyasae ching’ao, na gochisasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moise komotiga rirorio endamwamu yaye nigo er’abe enene ase more, erinde asieke igoro erio, embura tetwa, n’ense etige kwama, nainwe mokwe mosire ara rimo rioka timobao ase ense eria engiy’Omonene agochia kobaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amang’ana aya ane moyagache ase chinkoro chiaino ime, n’aase ebirengererio biaino. Moyasiberanie ase amaboko aino na moyabeeke ase amasio aino igoro, abe amariiko akobainyoria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyorokererie abana baino, mobe mokona‐koyairanerera ekero moikaransete ase chinyomba chiaino, n’ekero more ase orogeendo, n’ekero mogochia korara, n’ekero mokobooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyariike ase emetobwa n’aase emeriibo y’ebisieri bi’echinyomba chiaino, n’aase ebiita biaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nario inwe amo n’abana baino moramenye amatuko amaange ase ense eri’Omonene arierete chisokoro chiaino eira ng’a n’abayee ebe eyabo. Nigo moragenderere komenyao ase engaki koreng’ana buna igoro egendererete koba igoro y’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Komoraigwere na gokorera amachiiko aya onsi nabaeire, erinde momwanche Omonene Nyasae oino, naende motaare ase chinchera chiaye chionsi, na momobwatie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri’Omonene naseerie ebisaku ebi bionsi bire ase amasio aino, na inwe ’namonyaare koira ense y’ebisaku bire ebinene, naende bire ne chinguru kobabua inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase ande onsi morataare n’amagoro aino nabe aaino. Orogongo rwaino nigo rorachaakere ase erooro ya Irianyi na roikere Lebanoni, ensemo ya sugusu, naende rochaakere orooche rwa Eufarati ensemo ya moocha na roikere Enyancha Enene ya bosongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde tari oranyaare kobarwania na kobabua, ekiagera Omonene Nyasae oino, nakore abanto baabairoke inwe ase ense yonsi ase moraete. Naboigo abarierete eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naama! Rituko ria reero nabeekire ase amasio aino ogosesenigwa na okoragererigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo moranyore ogosesenigwa ko moraigwere amachiiko a Omonene Nyasae oino, aya ’nkobachiika rituko ria reero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende monyoore okoragererigwa ko moraange koigwera amachiiko a Omonene Nyasae oino, gose komoraonchoke korwa ase enchera eye ’nkobachiika rituko ria reero. Timobaisa gosasiima chinyasae chinde ching’ao, echio motamanyete agwo ritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omonene Nyasae oino, arabaikie ase ense eria mokogeenda koira, mokwane ogosesenigwa korwa ase egetunwa kia Gerisimu na okoragererigwa korwa ase egetunwa ki’Ebali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Buna momanyete, ebitunwa ebio bibere nigo bire bosongo y’orooche rwa Yorodani, ase Enchera ya Bosongo ase orogongo rw’ Abakaanani, baria bamenyete ase Ekerubo Ekiomo kororia Giligali, ang’e n’emete y’ emealuni agwo More.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
